{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01319",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.34,
      "end_seconds": 7.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "So, uh, morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.18,
      "end_seconds": 12.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.82,
      "end_seconds": 23.11,
      "duration_seconds": 9.29,
      "text": "It's, It's bloating after meals. I thought I'd wait, um, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.6,
      "end_seconds": 26.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.82,
      "end_seconds": 41.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.97,
      "end_seconds": 71.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.86,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 125 over 82, heart rate 76, SpO2 98 percent on room air. And temperature is 36.8 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.86,
      "end_seconds": 74.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.81,
      "end_seconds": 80.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "So, I'll come back to the numbers. Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.92,
      "end_seconds": 83.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Probably ten days. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.81,
      "end_seconds": 89.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Right, is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.16,
      "end_seconds": 92.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.25,
      "end_seconds": 97.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Has there been loose stools now and then too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.36,
      "end_seconds": 104.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Yeah. Four weeks, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.53,
      "end_seconds": 108.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Did you get night-time diarrhoea or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.63,
      "end_seconds": 115.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.35,
      "end_seconds": 124.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "And what about vomiting or blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.63,
      "end_seconds": 130.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Oh, you know, no, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.27,
      "end_seconds": 133.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.92,
      "end_seconds": 143.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "So, you know, no, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.32,
      "end_seconds": 165.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.43,
      "end_seconds": 168.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "I've had anxiety, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.22,
      "end_seconds": 177.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "Yes, anxiety is known to us, good to have that clear. What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.07,
      "end_seconds": 182.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.25,
      "end_seconds": 185.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.48,
      "end_seconds": 191.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.03,
      "end_seconds": 198.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.01,
      "end_seconds": 204.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Escitalopram. I take it 10 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.05,
      "end_seconds": 210.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.16,
      "end_seconds": 216.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "So, uh, not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.93,
      "end_seconds": 229.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.55,
      "end_seconds": 236.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Just part of my thyroid removed, years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.7,
      "end_seconds": 241.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.91,
      "end_seconds": 245.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.21,
      "end_seconds": 266.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and not tender, and I can't feel any lumps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.23,
      "end_seconds": 281.37,
      "duration_seconds": 12.14,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. Okay, thinking it through, this is probably a functional bowel pattern, with no alarm features. Irritable bowel syndrome is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.72,
      "end_seconds": 300.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "I'm going to order a coeliac blood test, for bloating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.61,
      "end_seconds": 306.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Oh, um, is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.3,
      "end_seconds": 312.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Try smaller meals and keep a food and symptom diary for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.0,
      "end_seconds": 328.04,
      "duration_seconds": 15.04,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Do get help quickly if you see blood in the stool or lose weight. We'll catch up in six weeks. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.74,
      "end_seconds": 335.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "So, I come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.96,
      "end_seconds": 340.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.92,
      "end_seconds": 345.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.48,
      "end_seconds": 348.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}